            <title>[IGNITE-2882] .NET: Examples fail on 32-bit OS</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2882</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Examples fail to start on 32-bit OS due to Xmx1024m&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Error message is not descriptive at all&lt;/li&gt;
